ue,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=23849"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=23849"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=23849"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":23866,"date":"2023-10-31T10:44:27","date_gmt":"2023-10-31T14:44:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=23866"},"modified":"2023-11-03T10:13:00","modified_gmt":"2023-11-03T14:13:00","slug":"kraken-pro-presents-futures-market-masters-2023","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/kraken-derivatives\/kraken-pro-presents-futures-market-masters-2023","title":{"rendered":"Kraken Pro presents: Futures Market Masters 2023"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Show off your trading skills and win big. $100k big.<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It\u2019s time \u2014 our 30-day futures trading contest <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/futures-competition?utm_campaign=2023_q4_pro_global_competition_2_2023_rtn\">has launched<\/a>. Show off your futures trading skills and win a share of the $100,000 USD prize pool.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Enrolment for the competition is now closed.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>When is the competition?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The competition will run until November 28th, 2023. You can track how much time is left on the <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/futures-competition?utm_campaign=2023_q4_pro_global_competition_2_2023_rtn\">competition page<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Ready to take on the markets? Here\u2019s everything you need to know:<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>$100,000 USD in total prizes await the competition\u2019s top traders<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The top 10 traders by PnL%, after the 30-day competition window closes, will split the $100,000 prize pool.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Your mission: climb the leaderboard<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Rise to the top of the real-time leaderboard by executing a winning strategy and placing in the top 10 by PnL%.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Let&#8217;s get you started<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"http:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/fmm2023-3\">Kraken Pro<\/a> is available to all Kraken clients, and our world-class support can help with the verification process whenever you need it.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Who is eligible?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You have to be in an <a href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/fmm2023-4\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/fmm2023-4\">eligible country<\/a> to trade futures with Kraken.**<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Meet the <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/15755255974548-Futures-Trading-Competitions-eligibility\">geographic requirements<\/a> to participate in a Kraken Derivatives promotion.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Both new and existing Futures clients can enter.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Your Kraken account is verified at Intermediate or Pro.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Market Makers and Institutional accounts are <strong>not<\/strong> eligible to win a prize.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">*For more details on terms and conditions, visit our <a href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/fmm2023-6\">Support Article<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">** Additional geo restrictions may apply.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>These materials are for general information purposes only and are not investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy, sell, stake or hold any cryptoasset or to engage in any specific trading strategy. Kraken will not undertake efforts to increase the value of any cryptoasset that you buy. Crypto products and markets are unregulated, and you may not be protected by government compensation and\/or regulatory protection schemes. The unpredictable nature of the cryptoasset markets can lead to loss of funds. Tax may be payable on any return and\/or on any increase in the value of your cryptoassets and you should seek independent advice on your taxation position. Geographic restrictions may apply.<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Show off your trading skills and win big. $100k big. It\u2019s time \u2014 our 30-day futures trading contest has launched. Show off your futures trading skills and win a share of the $100,000 USD prize pool. Enrolment for the competition is now closed. When is the competition? The competition will run until November 28th, 2023. [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":23869,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1723,1793],"tags":[1373,1403],"language":[],"class_list":["post-23866","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kraken-derivatives","category-promotions","tag-featured","tag-kraken"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Kraken Pro presents: Futures Market Masters 2023 - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n