,"templated":true}]}},{"id":23675,"date":"2023-10-31T13:08:15","date_gmt":"2023-10-31T17:08:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=23675"},"modified":"2023-10-31T20:56:31","modified_gmt":"2023-11-01T00:56:31","slug":"trading-for-celestia-tia-starts-now","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/asset-listings\/trading-for-celestia-tia-starts-now","title":{"rendered":"Trading for Celestia (TIA) starts now!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We\u2019re thrilled to announce that <strong>Celestia (TIA)<\/strong> is now available on Kraken!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Funding and trading<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">TIA funding and trading are live. Add TIA to your Kraken account by navigating to <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/funding\"><strong>Funding<\/strong><\/a>, selecting the asset, and hitting <strong>Deposit<\/strong>. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Only deposit TIA on Celestia. Deposits using other networks will be lost.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><em>Got TIA and a Kraken account? \u2935\ufe0f<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/kraken.app.link\/7aAwLVjJrDb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Deposit with Kraken<\/a>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/krakenpro.app.link\/lGZBO3cKrDb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Deposit with Kraken Pro<\/a>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">TIA is tradeable on <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kraken<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kraken Pro<\/a> with the following parameters:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#5841d8\" class=\"has-inline-color\"><strong>Asset<\/strong><\/mark><\/td><td><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#5841d8\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pair<\/mark><\/strong><\/td><td><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#5841d8\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Price decimal precision<\/mark><\/strong><\/td><td><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#5841d8\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Minimum order size<\/mark><\/strong><\/td><td><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#5841d8\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Minimum deposit<\/mark><\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>TIA<\/td><td>USD, EUR<\/td><td>4<\/td><td>3<\/td><td>2<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Note:&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Trading via Kraken App and Instant Buy will be available once the liquidity conditions are met<\/strong><em> (when a sufficient number of buyers and sellers have entered the market for their orders to be efficiently matched).<\/em><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here\u2019s what you need to know about the token:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Celestia (TIA)<\/strong> is a modular blockchain network focusing on scalable data availability for blockchains. By separating transaction ordering from network consensus, Celestia helps to address the data availability challenges many blockchains face while scaling. TIA is the native token used for data transactions, network security via proof-of-stake, and enabling decentralized governance within the ecosystem.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><em>Ready to trade but don&#8217;t have a Kraken account yet? <\/em><\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong><em>Sign up today<\/em><\/strong><\/a><strong><em>!&nbsp;<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get started with Kraken<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Will Kraken make more assets available?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details until shortly before launch \u2013 including which assets we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s available tokens can be found <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360000678446-Cryptocurrencies-available-on-Kraken\">here<\/a>, and all future tokens will be announced on Kraken\u2019s blog and social media profiles. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which assets we may be making available in the future.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Trade with caution<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There is no guarantee that a limit order will execute. There is also no guarantee a market order will execute at a certain price. The availability and liquidity of the particular digital asset will impact these types of orders.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/referrals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"213\" data-attachment-id=\"15784\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/subhead_reflink-1\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?fit=1200%2C250&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1200,250\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"subhead_reflink (1)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Referral cta image&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?fit=1024%2C213&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=1024%2C213&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Referral link image\" class=\"wp-image-15784\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=1024%2C213&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=300%2C63&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=768%2C160&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=200%2C42&amp;ssl=1 200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Celestia (TIA) is now available on Kraken! Funding and trading TIA funding and trading are live. Add TIA to your Kraken account by navigating to Funding, selecting the asset, and hitting Deposit. Only deposit TIA on Celestia. Deposits using other networks will be lost. Got TIA and a Kraken account? [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089380,"featured_media":23676,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1789],"tags":[1373,1814],"language":[],"class_list":["post-23675","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-asset-listings","tag-featured","tag-tia"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Trading for Celestia (TIA) starts now! - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/asset-listings\/trading-for-celestia-tia-starts-now\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Trading for Celestia (TIA) starts now!\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" co